cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this plugin, please cite it using the metadata below, and cite the method (Thode et al. 2019)."
type: software
title: "Azigram: a PAMGuard plugin for displaying directional information from DIFAR sonobuoys"
abstract: >-
  A PAMGuard plugin that shows directional information from DIFAR sonobuoys.
  The Azigram looks like a spectrogram, but colour shows the bearing of arrival
  in each time-frequency cell. It implements the Azigram algorithm and the
  frequency domain demultiplexing of DIFAR signals described by Thode et al. (2019).
